            <ArticleTitle>Do not underestimate your patient's back pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>358-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Back pain is a common complaint in the elderly population which is often attributed to osteoarthritis or vertebral collapse secondary to osteoporosis. The following case reports describe an easily-missed cause of back pain which is becoming increasingly important and thus should be actively sought.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
